Cell["\<\
Based on equ 5.2.5 of \[OpenCurlyQuote]The Power Of \
Alpha\[CloseCurlyQuote](TPOA) by Malcolm H.MacGregoras the model 

The potentual energy of eXt-\[OpenCurlyQuote]not\[CloseCurlyQuote] pair is \
PtEgr === (eXt^2)/2r

r is the speration distance, value to be determend but assumed for now as \
either 1 or Pi

\
\>", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.512779141359375*^9, 3.51277915321875*^9}, 
